{"id":"bagnole","lemma":"bagnole","pos":"noun","rank":2656,"glosses":["ride; whip; wheels (an automobile)"],"ipa":"/ba.ɲɔl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/66/Fr-bagnole.ogg/Fr-bagnole.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"bagnoles"},"formAudio":{"bagnoles":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/99/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Guilhelma-Bagnoles.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La bagnole est prête.","en":"The car is ready.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/79787","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"ready","l":"prêt"}]},{"text":"Je déteste cette bagnole.","en":"I hate this car.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hate, to detest","l":"détester"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]},{"text":"Une bagnole a un volant.","en":"A car has one steering wheel.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"steering wheel"}]},{"text":"Finalement, j'ai ma propre bagnole.","en":"Finally, I have my own car.","words":[{"g":"finally"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"my","l":"mon"},{"g":"own"},null]},{"text":"Ce sont les bagnoles de nos profs.","en":"Those are our teachers' cars.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"our","l":"notre"},{"g":"teacher, professor","l":"prof"}]}]}